</p>
<p>
    <strong>Personal income by county</strong>
</p>
<p>
<a href="https://apps.bea.gov/itable/?ReqID=70&step=1#">Table CAINC1. County Personal Income Summary (Percent Change From Preceding Period)</a><br />
